*> PLB-Q009 update-of-read-only-cursor: a positioned UPDATE or DELETE
*> through a cursor declared without FOR UPDATE.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. POSUPD.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-ID                   PIC S9(9) COMP.
01  WS-BALANCE              PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE READ-CUR CURSOR FOR
        SELECT ACCT_ID, BALANCE FROM ACCOUNT
         ORDER BY ACCT_ID
    END-EXEC.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE UPD-CUR CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
        SELECT ACCT_ID, BALANCE FROM ACCOUNT
           FOR UPDATE OF BALANCE
    END-EXEC.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC SQL OPEN READ-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL FETCH READ-CUR INTO :WS-ID, :WS-BALANCE END-EXEC
    *> Reported: READ-CUR has no FOR UPDATE.
    EXEC SQL UPDATE ACCOUNT SET BALANCE = :WS-BALANCE
        WHERE CURRENT OF READ-CUR
    END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL DELETE FROM ACCOUNT WHERE CURRENT OF READ-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL CLOSE READ-CUR END-EXEC
    *> Fine: UPD-CUR is declared FOR UPDATE.
    EXEC SQL OPEN UPD-CUR END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL FETCH UPD-CUR INTO :WS-ID, :WS-BALANCE END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL UPDATE ACCOUNT SET BALANCE = :WS-BALANCE
        WHERE CURRENT OF UPD-CUR
    END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL CLOSE UPD-CUR END-EXEC
    STOP RUN.
